%% IP address life cycle, derived from ip_assignments (open means upper(during) is null).
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> free : in the fixed pool
  free --> held : server created, Add IP, or restore (IP row locked)
  held --> held : move to another server, old period closed and new one opened in one tx
  held --> free : release, or holder terminated or failed
  note right of held
    At most one open assignment per IP at any moment
    (EXCLUDE ip_id with =, during with &&).
    Billed per UTC hour while the holder server runs.
    One charge per IP and hour; the first holder in that hour pays.
  end note
